{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the smallest integral value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/684666741d25abc15ab55d259373ad3447b8bd32.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2x(kx-4)-x^2+6=0\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"19\" />\nhas no real roots?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/d/47d188ac247258bf342d95554a6dbf7f9cce9449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } -1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 4 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"364\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/a/f4a3b8328eed37719d90bdb608ca855fe92f771c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2kx^2-8x-x^2+6=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"183\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/5/8f598184b3d4fd60188fc52d3bd196cf7e98815c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2k-1)x^2-8x+6=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"188\" height=\"19\" />. For this quadratic not to have real roots, it must have a negative discriminant. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/4/9b402223d322b986b18359ae18ebd1a39b4a13af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-8)^2-4(2k-1)(6)&lt;0\\implies 64-48k+24&lt;0\\implies k&gt;\\frac{11}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"493\" height=\"37\" />. From here, we can easily see that the smallest integral value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/e/cceece38751465e108b9be2165580c1cb4aee9a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2, \\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem